<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="cyc-page sc-page">
{# Sector Cycle Intelligence — data-driven cycle map for the 11 US sector ETFs.
   A sibling of Cycle Intelligence (cycle.html): it REUSES that page's design system
   (cycle.css) + the mm_charts.js SVG engine, but every line is the sector ETF's REAL
   price (rebased / log) with a one-click "cycle position" oscillator toggle, and the
   turns / phase / projection are derived from the tape by engine/sector_cycles.py.
   Data + narratives are emitted by scripts/build_sector_cycles.py as
   sector_cycles_data.js; this template owns only the page shell + shared nav. #}
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<script>try{var t=localStorage.getItem('theme');document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t||'dark');var l=localStorage.getItem('lang');if(l)document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-lang',l);}catch(e){}</script>
<title>Sector Cycle Intelligence — Mastermind</title>
<meta name="description" content="Every US sector ETF on one cycle clock — real price (rebased / log) with a cycle-position toggle, auto-detected peaks & troughs, the phase each sector sits in (topping · expanding · rolling over · bottoming), and the story behind each move.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="theme.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="cycle.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="sector_cycles.css">
</head>
<body>
<nav class="site-nav" style="max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;padding:11px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap">
  <a class="nav-brand" href="index.html" style="font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-size:16px;color:var(--text);text-decoration:none">MASTERMIND</a>
  {% include "_navlinks.html.j2" %}
  <div class="nav-ctrls" style="margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
    <button class="lang-btn" type="button">中文</button>
    <button class="theme-btn" type="button">☀️ Light</button>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="cyc-wrap">
  <header class="cyc-hd">
    <div class="ht">
      <div class="cyc-kicker"><span class="hb"></span> <span class="l-en">Sector Cycle Intelligence</span><span class="l-zh">板块周期智慧</span></div>
      <h1 class="cyc-title"><span class="l-en">Where every US sector stands</span><span class="l-zh">每个美股板块所处的位置</span></h1>
      <p class="cyc-sub"><span class="l-en">The 11 GICS sector ETFs on one cycle clock — real price (rebased &amp; log, so every
        line shares an axis) with a one-tap <b>cycle-position</b> view. Peaks &amp; troughs are auto-detected from the tape,
        each sector is graded by where it sits in its cycle, and clicking a leg tells you what drove the move.</span><span class="l-zh">11 个 GICS 板块 ETF 同处一张周期时钟——真实价格（再基准化并取对数，使每条线共用同一坐标轴），并可一键切换为<b>周期位置</b>视图。波峰与波谷由价格走势自动识别，每个板块按其周期所处阶段评级，点击任一区段即可了解推动该走势的原因。</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="cyc-ctrls">
      <span class="cyc-asof"><span class="l-en">As of</span><span class="l-zh">截至</span> <span id="sc-asof">…</span></span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="cyc-stage">
    <div class="cyc-hero">
      <div class="cyc-hero-hd">
        <h2><span class="l-en">Sector rotation overlay</span><span class="l-zh">板块轮动叠加</span></h2>
        <div class="cyc-hero-tools">
          <div class="sc-modes" id="sc-modes" aria-label="Chart mode">
            <button class="sc-mbtn on" data-mode="price"><span class="l-en">Price</span><span class="l-zh">价格</span></button>
            <button class="sc-mbtn" data-mode="osc"><span class="l-en">Cycle position</span><span class="l-zh">周期位置</span></button>
          </div>
          <div class="sc-scale" id="sc-scale" aria-label="Price scale">
            <button class="sc-sbtn on" data-scale="log"><span class="l-en">Log</span><span class="l-zh">对数</span></button>
            <button class="sc-sbtn" data-scale="linear"><span class="l-en">Linear</span><span class="l-zh">线性</span></button>
          </div>
          <div class="cyc-legend">
            <span><i class="ls"></i> <span class="l-en">Price</span><span class="l-zh">价格</span></span>
            <span><i class="lm lm-pk"></i> <span class="l-en">Peak</span><span class="l-zh">波峰</span></span>
            <span><i class="lm lm-tr"></i> <span class="l-en">Trough</span><span class="l-zh">波谷</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="cyc-zoom" id="sc-zoom" aria-label="Zoom"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cyc-groups" id="sc-groups" aria-label="Phase filter"></div>
      <div class="cyc-chips" id="sc-chips" aria-label="Sector toggles"></div>
      <div id="sc-chart" data-h="468" role="img" aria-label="Sector cycle overlay chart"></div>
    </div>

    <aside class="cyc-detail" id="sc-detail">
      <div class="cyc-handle" id="sc-handle" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="cyc-panels">
        <div class="cyc-panel show" id="sc-panel-default"></div>
        <div class="cyc-panel" id="sc-panel-focus"></div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <div class="cyc-cards-hd">
    <h2><span class="l-en">Sector scorecards</span><span class="l-zh">板块记分卡</span></h2>
    <span class="sub"><span class="l-en">Tap any card — or its line on the chart — to focus it</span><span class="l-zh">点按任意卡片（或图中其曲线）以聚焦</span></span>
  </div>
  <div class="cyc-cards" id="sc-cards"></div>
</div>

<script src="sector_cycles_data.js"></script>
<script src="mm_charts.js"></script>
<script src="sector_cycles.js"></script>
<script>try{document.getElementById('sc-asof').textContent=(window.SECTOR_CYCLES&&window.SECTOR_CYCLES.meta||{}).asOf||'';}catch(e){}</script>
<script src="theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
